    "updated_at": "2019-04-23T17:35:56Z",
    "body": "`Probably` signifies that the caller might have made a mistake (perhaps intentionally) and you'll have to validate it being UTF-8. This cannot be avoided as far as I can tell. You make a good point that we might not want full parity with the other typed array API objects, so perhaps using a different name is okay. Either way, seems like something to run by TC39 if this proceeds.",
