    "created_at": "2019-04-26T23:12:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-04-26T23:12:13Z",
    "body": "I don't really see how this could work as an immutable thing. How would you change the heap from mutating out from under you, without copying or something like mprotect?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
