    "created_at": "2019-04-27T08:25:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-04-27T08:25:20Z",
    "body": "I agree--Making an immutable view over an object which may mutate sounds like a good design for this case. I think we need to make the semantics well-defined, though, meaning the runtime could not trust the developer.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
